.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/cps/image.kdl
Default configuration for system commands.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/sysimage/cps/
Package database, transaction staging, prepared kernel files, and vendor configuration proposals within an image. Packages never ship /var, which tmpfiles.d populates at boot.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
\&cps search editor
\&sudo cps upgrade \-\-dry\-run
\&cps plan \-\-root image \-\-output update.json update
\&cps apply \-\-root image update.json
.EE
